vlet:4.0.5`.\n\nPreserved work: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9946-library-new-request-com.sun.xml.ws-httpspi-servlet-4.0.5-0b98a66b\n\nThe likely blocker is Native Image class initialization rather than missing reachability metadata. The final `nativeTestCompile` repeatedly fails because `com.ctc.wstx.stax.WstxInputFactory` is stored in the image heap while configured for runtime initialization, reached through `DeploymentDescriptorParserTest.java:48`. The metadata agent reported that the traced reflection and service-resource entries were already present and made no further changes because the required initialization option cannot be represented by a conditional `typeReached` entry. Metrics record failure after 13 iterations, with no final coverage or metadata measurements.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-09-27T11-13-33-423121Z.log`\n- `logs/com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5/issue-requested-metadata/pi.log`\n- `logs/com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-27T11-11-41-102690Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Review `DeploymentDescriptorParserTest` on the preserved branch and decide whether it should be rewritten to avoid embedding `WstxInputFactory`, or whether a supported class-initialization configuration is appropriate.\n2. Re-run `./gradlew test -Pcoordinates=com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5` and confirm both JVM and Native Image tests pass.\n3. Validate the retained metadata with `./gradlew checkMetadataFiles -Pcoordinates=com.sun.xml.ws:httpspi-servlet:4.0.5` before preparing the contribution.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_011606fb4c7bf6b4016ab8fad6b09887d285cc2d2106913a4d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 24534, "output": 979, "cacheRead": 124928, "cacheWrite": 0, "reason